{"4730820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "internal power", "steam_appid": 4730820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5011290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning may be ordinary, but the ending is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just an ordinary adventurer, equipped with the most basic gear, stepping into your first dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill turns into material, and every forging forges hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade skills, activate talents, and inlay runes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the equipment crafted by your own hands to conquer trials with escalating difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This treasure chest is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/235af78644f78751c570bf8de283097c.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/235af78644f78751c570bf8de283097c.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/235af78644f78751c570bf8de283097c.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and combat styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types, each with its own skill tree and distinct combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of equipment comes with unique skills - choosing the right weapon is choosing the right fighting style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/2d632776f7a242dd2d9c4624d58ea76d.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/2d632776f7a242dd2d9c4624d58ea76d.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/2d632776f7a242dd2d9c4624d58ea76d.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple replicas, multiple mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every instance is a brand new adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes multiple dungeons with distinct styles. Each dungeon not only boasts a unique visual theme and monster lineup, but also features distinct differences in core gameplay mechanics. You will never clear all dungeons using the same strategy - strategy, equipment, and combat methods must be tailored to the specific situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character growth system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrade - make every move more devastating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent Specialization - Define Your Combat Philosophy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment crafting - transforming blueprints into divine weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Refinement - Pushing Equipment to the Extreme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Inlay - Customizable Entries with Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment upgrade, strengthening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The finished equipment is just a starting point, and it can be pushed to a higher level through strengthening and refining</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the freedom of refinement, allowing you to choose and retain your preferred attributes for a more flexible combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/98110434ab6b365283ab763cea8db45c.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/98110434ab6b365283ab763cea8db45c.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/98110434ab6b365283ab763cea8db45c.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiered difficulty, treasure chest rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty is not simply a numerical accumulation, but a comprehensive evolution of mechanisms, strategies, risks, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose an appropriate difficulty level based on your current combat strength, or you can challenge yourself to prove your limits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon completion of the dungeon, you can obtain a treasure chest reward. The quality and contents of the treasure chest are linked to the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/a78c9eeaf63188c4a66a3e368883b871.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/a78c9eeaf63188c4a66a3e368883b871.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/a78c9eeaf63188c4a66a3e368883b871.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning may be ordinary, but the ending is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just an ordinary adventurer, equipped with the most basic gear, stepping into your first dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill turns into material, and every forging forges hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade skills, activate talents, and inlay runes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the equipment crafted by your own hands to conquer trials with escalating difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This treasure chest is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/235af78644f78751c570bf8de283097c.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com