820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/5a1c8b53ed9149b16cbb7c3f051487f8.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character growth system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrade - make every move more devastating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent Specialization - Define Your Combat Philosophy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment crafting - transforming blueprints into divine weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Refinement - Pushing Equipment to the Extreme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Inlay - Customizable Entries with Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.poster.avif?t=1788114386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.webm?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730820/extras/684b397ccd801351189fb8fbc95ac72e.mp4?t=1788114386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment upgrade, strengthening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The finished equipment is just a starting point, and it can be pushed to a higher level through strengthening and refining</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the freedom of refinement, allowing you to choose and retain your preferred attributes for a more flexible